      "description": "The KG operations sub-graph — a NAMED SUB-GRAPH of the harness, OPT-IN like `sdlc`: off in every layer unless that layer lists `cat-harness.kg-ops` in its own `enableSubgraphs` (owner, 2026-11-10, card Q-SG-1 C, wave 2). It holds the `kg-ops` skill package (N-Quads distribution, named SPARQL queries, edge kinds and blast radius, domain fencing), their two processes and `witness-parity`. KG separation, sub-KG life cycle, LSI and rendering stay in `graph-management`, because always-on skills, Tools and visualisers cite them. Declared FROM WITHIN in `kg-ops/graph.json`.",
